    "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>For Harshita ✨</title>\n    <style>\n        body { margin: 0; padding: 0; min-height: 100vh; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff9a9e 0%, #fecfef 99%); font-family: Segoe UI, Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; }\n        .card { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.9); padding: 40px; border-radius: 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); text-align: center; max-width: 400px; width: 90%; }\n        h1 { color: #ff4b2b; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 2.2em; }\n        h2 { color: #ff416c; font-weight: 400; margin-top: 0; }\n        p { color: #555; font-size: 1.1em; line-height: 1.6; margin: 20px 0; }\n        .buttons { margin-top: 30px; display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 20px; position: relative; }\n        button { padding: 12px 28px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: bold; border: none; border-radius: 25px; cursor: pointer; }\n        .yes-btn { background-color: #ff4b2b; color: white; }\n        .yes-btn:hover { transform: scale(1.1); background-color: #ff416c; }\n        .no-btn { background-color: #ddd; color: #333; position: absolute; right: 40px; }\n        .hidden-message { display: none; margin-top: 20px; color: #ff4b2b; font-size: 1.3em; font-weight: bold; }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"card\">\n        <h1>Hey Harshita ❤️</h1>\n        <h2>(My Yori)</h2>\n        <p>I have been wanting to tell you something special... You make every day brighter just by being in it, and I have completely fallen for you.</p>\n        <p><strong>Will you be mine?</strong></p>\n        <div class=\"buttons\" id=\"btnGroup\">\n            <button class=\"yes-btn\" onclick=\"acceptLove()\">Yes!</button>\n            <button class=\"no-btn\" id=\"noBtn\" onmouseover=\"moveButton()\">No</button>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"hidden-message\" id=\"responseMessage\">💖 I love you, Yori! You just made my day! 💖</div>\n    </div>\n    <script>\n        function moveButton() { var noBtn = document.getElementById(\"noBtn\"); var x = Math.random() * (window.innerWidth - noBtn.offsetWidth - 100); var y = Math.random() * (window.innerHeight - noBtn.offsetHeight - 100); noBtn.style.position = \"fixed\"; noBtn.style.left = x + \"px\"; noBtn.style.top = y + \"px\"; }\n        function acceptLove() { document.getElementById(\"btnGroup\").style.display = \"none\"; document.getElementById(\"responseMessage\").style.display = \"block\"; }\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>",
